## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

Exact Exaltolide skin texture, cardamom lot/temporal profile, target sandalwood, and Haitian vetiver remain gaps. Existing materials cover the test direction; do not buy another musk or spice. Verify EB before mixing and keep all tinctures excluded.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

Compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LN-03 and LN-01 in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Judge cardamom authority, opening-to-heart continuity, velvet integration, cineolic/opaque failure, and liking. No physical result exists.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

